This is the final program for operating the NAVFAC Pipe Viper.
; It is a software suite for controlling the device and capturing data from it.
; It is written in C and is paired with arduino code for two microcontrollers on the system.
; It is designed to be run on a Linux OS, and has been tested on Ubuntu 24.04 LTS.
; It is a terminal-based program that uses the ncurses library for user interface.
; I don't know if NAVFAC uses linux, but this program has 
;also been tested on Linux running on a virtual machine in Windows 11.
; This program COULD be run on a Raspberry Pi. Just sayin'.


